  "description": "Supabase integration for the DDDToolkit: exports Entity Framework migrations as Supabase migration files as part of the build, so supabase db push, db reset and branching apply them, and fails a CI build when one was not exported. The [RowAccess] rules go along as Supabase policies, and DTS.DDD.EntityFramework.Postgres's row level security runs the application's own queries under Supabase's roles.",
